//! Twelve actual validators run a paid cross-root exchange through supervised AMX relays.
//!
//! The test submits owner approval and one Begin. Every Prepare, Prepared relay, expiry
//! and settlement carrier is generated by the node service; final evidence is verified
//! independently against each exact signed genesis and the successful original inputs.

